WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.190
Hey, did you hear?

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:09.810
That third grader Yada Masaru got in trouble with the teachers again.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.790
Really? What did he do this time?

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.860
I'm sure it's nothing good.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:56.130
Scoop! Scoop! The raging school grader Yada Masaru beats up junior high students!

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:58.880
Is that true?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:03.140
According to my sources, this was the reason he was scolded by the teachers yesterday.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.600
Oh no! I can't believe I'm in the same class as he is.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.900
How many junior high students?

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.480
I heard there were three students.

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:11.810
That's so cool!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.170
He beat up some junior high students?

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:15.570
He's got some guts!

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:17.450
Did something happen to Yada-kun?

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.790
Yada-kun is a Delinquent!?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.970
Ah, this is only better than last time by 10 points.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.930
Ouch, that sucks!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.640
But, you should be glad you improved by 10 points.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.480
That's true I guess.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.770
Yada Masaru.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.740
What's the meaning of this?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.820
Of what?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.490
How come you didn't write anything?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:05.950
No reason.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.160
Try to do something next time.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.390
Masaru!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:23.850
Yes?

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.810
You're not singing seriously.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.270
I'm not doing such childish things.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.980
Then go stand in the hall.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.200
Scary...

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.530
Today's essay is "My Teacher."

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.950
Everyone, don't hesitate to write whatever you like.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.140
Masaru.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:06.970
Yes?

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.220
Are you done?

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.140
Yes.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.520
Well, let's hear it!

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.560
"My Teacher."

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.230
Is ugly.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.410
You've got some nerves.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:26.870
Not really.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.990
Come here for a moment.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:31.120
Oh no!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.620
Dead man walking.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.670
The rooftop is very refreshing, isn't it?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.890
Aren't you going to yell at me?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:51.390
Masaru, maybe you need to get your eyes checked.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.020
Calling this beautiful woman ugly means you can't see very well.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.070
I heard your dad is coming home.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:04.780
Being a businessman must be awful. Germany this time?

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.320
Yes.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.660
When will he be home?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.120
In the morning.

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.080
That's great.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.040
Not really.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.540
You don't say much, do you?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:20.500
If there's nothing else, I'm going back.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:25.130
I don't have anything else. But don't you have anything to say?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.470
Not really. See ya.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.390
He really doesn't say much.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.240
Masaru! Are you okay?

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:46.320
Did she hit you? Once, or maybe even three times?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.870
Did you counter with a kick?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:49.990
That's not it.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.660
Any killer moves?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.910
Can I interview you later?

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:54.580
How awful!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.580
It's none of your business.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.330
Yada-kun...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:05.130
We have to be more diligent so that we can make more money.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:10.390
The more you make, the more expensive goods you'll sell.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.550
For that purpose...

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.260
Alright! Done!

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.140
How's that? I'm very confident of this one.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.180
Ah, yer right.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.140
Right, right?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.400
Doremi, that's a magnificent yellowtail fish.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:21.940
Yellowtail fish?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.900
Come on, Majo Rika! That's not a yellowtail.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:26.860
It isn't?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.570
Of course! Because this is...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.200
This is...

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:34.990
A sardine?

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.040
Ah! That's not it! That's not what I meant!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.870
That's so rude to Doremi-chan!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.290
This is...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:47.340
I think that's a... What's it called again, Doremi-chan?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:47.880
A dolphin!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.260
Ah, that's it!

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.970
Ah, I thought so too!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.470
I ain't good in biology.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.260
Me too!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.350
Hadzuki-chan, dont'cha think so too?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.140
Huh?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.070
What is it, Rere?

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.320
What's goin' on?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.780
Something's not right.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:08.570
Is it?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.150
Ya should tell us if ya got problems.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.570
Right, right!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:17.540
Thank you. It's not that I have problems. I'm just a bit worried about Masaru-kun.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.910
Masaru-kun?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.540
About Yada-kun?

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.040
Y-yeah.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.840
Yada-kun and I went to the same kindergarten.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.880
Yada-kun was such a gentle boy then.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.720
When I was playing in the park, I fell down and injured myself.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:37.390
Yada-kun was the one who helped me. Not only that, he also carried me all the way home.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:42.900
It's just that he's always misunderstood.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.440
But he never argued about it.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:48.480
So that's how it is.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.150
That's why I can't believe Yada-kun would do such a thing.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:55.660
I think there must be a reason behind all this.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.200
Even though Yada-kun looks tough, he's never resorted to violence.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.260
You're too naïve!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:05.540
You're too naïve, Hadzuki! That was when you were in kindergarten!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:09.590
Humans can change a lot in five years.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.550
No way!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.140
People can easily become evil.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.930
Majo Rika! Don't say things like that!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:18.760
I'm just telling the truth!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.730
Majo Rika!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.790
Scoop! Scoop!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:41.640
What?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.620
What's goin' on?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.040
Yada...

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:44.790
Masaru...

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.630
was arrested by the police!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:48.920
Really?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:49.710
Is that true?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.170
There's no way!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.220
Last night, Yada Masaru from Misora Elementary, third grade, class two...

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:59.010
...was caught sneaking into warehouse #8 at the pier.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:03.350
In light to recent development, what do you think as his classmates?

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:06.400
I will interview you one by one.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.900
I still can't believe he'd do such a thing!

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:15.860
I knew he'd do something like that. I'm so ashamed to be in the same class as him.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.320
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:19.530
It's not true!

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.660
I... I'm telling the truth. Don't you trust my sources?

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:27.630
Yada-kun is not that kind of person. Why do you say such a thing, Kaori-chan?

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:31.170
These are the facts. The proof is that our first period was changed to study hall.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.840
That's a lie lie lie!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.880
Hadzuki-chan.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.760
Cool yer jets.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:39.010
There must be a mistake! I'm going to find out the truth!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.390
Hadzuki-chan!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:47.350
I just know for sure that Masaru-kun is not a bad person.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.810
Geez, this is such a big problem!
Principal's Office

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.400
Now now, calm down.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.480
Mr. Principal!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.070
Yada Masaru is a troublemaker, as I always said!

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.700
This time the police even arrested him for sneaking into a warehouse!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:01.700
No way!

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.580
No way!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.730
Circumstances aside, do you know for sure that Yada Masaru did anything bad?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:36.990
There is no reason. He didn't speak at all to the police.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:40.660
If he didn't do anything bad, he should've told them so.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.530
However!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:43.340
You're too naïve! Too naïve!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:46.910
Things like this always lead to even bigger problems, right, Mr. Principal?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:49.580
That's not true!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.410
Huh?

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:51.460
Who are you?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.670
Masaru-kun is not that kind of person!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.170
Fujiwara?

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.420
Mr. Principal and Mr. Vice Principal!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:01.640
Masaru-kun is not a bad person. He must have a reason.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.770
I agree with Fujiwara.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:08.430
Then he should've come to school! The fact that he didn't means something is wrong!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:13.840
Yada's mother could only smile too when we told her what happened.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:19.030
Geez! The only ones sneaking in at nights are robbers! Robbers, I say!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:25.740
I trust my students! Yada is not that kind of person!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.620
Seki-sensei!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.540
There's no need to be violent.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:35.590
When Yada Masaru commits a crime in the future, I'll hold you responsible, Seki-sensei!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.460
Fine.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.800
If that happens, I'll resign as a teacher.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.220
What are you doing here?

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:48.140
Hey, this is the principal's office! Get out of here at once!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.010
What was Yada-kun doing at the warehouse?

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:52.590
That's the problem.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.420
At this rate, Seki-sensei will get fired!

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.020
I'm going.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.910
I'm going to check the warehouse while it's still study hall.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.960
Alright, gotcha!

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.450
We're going with you, though.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.720
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.850
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.770
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.610
Warehouse #8 is that one!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.450
There ain't anyone in there.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.910
Let's sneak in.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.240
Yow!

00:12:55.240 --> 00:12:56.240
Shhh!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:56.920
Okay.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.630
How are we gonna investigate this?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.300
Study hall will be over by the time we check out the whole place.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.040
At a time like this...

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.970
Yep. Time for Magical Stage!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.560
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.480
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.610
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.320
Magical Stage!

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.990
Tell us what Yada-kun was doing.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:42.640
This is...

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.500
a video remote control.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.710
What gives?

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.590
Did we fail?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.510
Maybe the video has something to do with Yada-kun.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.060
Doremi-chan...

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:54.890
Look at that!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.690
A flashback to last night?

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.320
Doremi-chan, press the replay button!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:04.740
'Kay!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.360
Masaru-kun?

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.950
It's so dark, I can't see nothin'.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:10.930
He got something.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:11.910
Looks like a bag.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.310
What was that?

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:17.830
Go back! Do a slow replay!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:18.290
'Kay!

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.340
I still can't see nothin'.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.560
Masaru-kun!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:50.820
Alright...

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.470
Something's inside.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:53.440
Let's open it.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.200
You think that's okay?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.080
Nothin's gonna happen.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:55.490
Yeah.

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:57.500
Huh?

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:58.000
What?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.120
Why this?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.250
So mysterious.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.750
Is this a trumpet?

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.760
Yeah. I wonder if Masaru-kun is practicing it.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.940
Why's he practicin' in a place like this?

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:15.030
Yeah, really...

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:18.240
Should we put it back inside?

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:19.060
You guys!

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.600
What are you doing?

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.110
Masaru-kun!

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.610
Err... well, what are we doin'...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.020
Actually, nothing important.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.900
Ah! That's mine!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.910
Give it back to me!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.110
We can't!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.170
No way! No way!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.960
We're going to give it back once we're back in school.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:39.360
Let go!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:43.710
Masaru-kun, you didn't do anything bad, so let's just talk to Seki-sensei!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.800
If you don't, Seki-sensei will get fired!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.010
So you <i>are</i>  here!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.970
Harukaze... What are you guys doing here?

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.930
We're sorry.

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.130
Come, Masaru.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:01.100
Let's go to school.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.990
If I don't go back, you'll get fired, right?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.570
Oh dear.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.330
That's none of your business.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:20.320
Obviously you don't want to get fired, so that's why you're here.

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:21.990
I know your intention.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:25.540
Fine, I'll go back. It'd be a pity if you got fired.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.000
You mind your tongue!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.460
A kid like you shouldn't be so cheeky!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.630
What?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.500
Masaru!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.560
You know what? If you didn't do anything wrong, just say so!

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:40.880
The police, the principal, the vice principal.... Just tell them so.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.940
Why can't you do something so simple?

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.950
If you don't open your mouth, no one will understand you!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:48.730
Shut up!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.240
Are you afraid to tell the truth?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.150
No, I'm not!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.820
If you can't do that, then aren't you still just a brat?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:55.700
Shut up!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:58.120
When will you stop running away from your problems!?

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.330
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:07.220
Even if... Even if I tell the truth, no one will believe me!

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:09.290
Damnit! Teacher, you don't know anything!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.140
You're an idiot! An idiot!

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:13.380
I hate you! I hate you! I hate you so much!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.100
Trust me.

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:26.020
I want to know more about you, Masaru.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:31.730
I'm sure I won't be able to know everything about you.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.110
But I already knew that you have courage.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:37.860
That's why...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.980
That's why you should tell me.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.000
What made you want to hit me...

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.370
Please.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:50.000
I'm on your side, Masaru. Believe me.

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.550
Masaru-kun...

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.100
I see.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:06.310
The reason you came to the warehouse at night was to practice alone.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.520
Practicing in front of people can be embarrassing at times, right?

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.570
Is that bad?

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.300
No, I understand.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.960
Eh? You do?

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:20.830
I do. In order to become a grade school teacher, I had to take piano lessons.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.990
Piano is not my strong point.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.040
So, I always practiced when no one was around.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.290
Because I wanted to become a grade school teacher no matter what.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:35.130
Surprised? You're not the only one who gets embarrassed.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:37.260
Not really.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.140
Actually...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.890
I got this from my Dad.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.310
Before Dad went to Germany...

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:58.660
Masaru.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.530
Dad's gotta go for a while.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.580
Just go then.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.500
Come with me, Masaru.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.000
What?

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.800
Masaru, you can have this.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.270
Take care of Mom, Masaru.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.310
Okay.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:57.510
I see.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:59.730
And tomorrow your Dad comes back.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:00.730
Yeah.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.360
So that's why you've been practicin'.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.320
Then, what about beating up the junior high students?

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.820
Whenever I practiced...

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:12.000
They always teased me and took my trumpet.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.170
That's so mean! Why would they do that?

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.250
However, violence is never the answer! Never!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:21.170
Yes, ma'am...

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:30.220
I'm glad to know his Dad is a wonderful person.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.810
I'm sure he'll understand once he tells him what's going on.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:33.980
That's great! That's great!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.440
Oh, don't think you three can get off that easily.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:40.020
You skipped study hall to come here.

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.650
I'm gonna see you all in detention.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.470
Eh? That gentle Nanako-chan skipped her turn to take care of our animal?

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.140
What an animal hater!

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.360
She used to love animals.

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:10.820
Did somethin' happen?

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:15.820
I know! If we use level 7 magic, we might be able to do something.

00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:17.510
The magic to talk to plants, right?

00:22:17.510 --> 00:22:20.340
But we can't talk to animals yet.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:22.580
We haven't learned that kind of magic yet.

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:23.760
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:26.010
Don't Use That! The Forbidden Magic.

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:28.710
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
